request.description:
Link or reorder document attachments on a product

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `product_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product to update attachments for |
| `_attachments` | object[] | yes | List of attachments to link, reorder, or unlink |

**Example: Link attachment to product**. Set _delete=true on an attachment entry to unlink it from the product.

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "saveProductAttachment",
  "params": {
    "product_id": 123,
    "_attachments": [
      {
        "product_attachment_id": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "_delete": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "product_id": 123
}
```

Retrieve brands

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
| `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
| `brand_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by internal brand IDs |
| `external_brand_id` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by your system's reference IDs for brands |
| `include_brand_images` | boolean | no | Include brand images in the response |

**Example: First page of brands**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "getBrands",
  "params": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 3
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "brands": [
    {
      "brand_id": 1,
      "brand_name": "Acme",
      "external_brand_id": "ACME"
    },
    {
      "brand_id": 2,
      "brand_name": "BrandX",
      "external_brand_id": null
    }
  ],
  "page": {
    "number_of_items": 2,
    "items_per_page": 3,
    "number_of_pages": 1,
    "current_page": 1
  }
}
```

Retrieve ETIM features with optional translations. Filter by class code to get only features belonging to that class.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
| `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–2500) |
| `etim_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter to features belonging to this ETIM class code (e.g. "EC000001") |
| `etim_release` | string (nullable) | no | ETIM release to resolve the class version (e.g. "ETIM-9.0"); used with etim_class_code |
| `search_query` | string (nullable) | no | Free-text search on feature description or code |
| `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include translations for (e.g. ["nl", "en"]) |

**Example: Features for EC002713 (ETIM-10.0)**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "getEtimFeatures",
  "params": {
    "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
    "etim_release": "ETIM-10.0"
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "etim_features": [
    {
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
      "etim_feature_type": "N"
    },
    {
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000006",
      "etim_feature_type": "A"
    },
    {
      "etim_feature_code": "EF000012",
      "etim_feature_type": "L"
    }
  ],
  "page": {
    "number_of_items": 3,
    "items_per_page": 100,
    "number_of_pages": 1,
    "current_page": 1
  }
}
```

Retrieve ETIM values with optional translations. Filter by class and/or feature code to get only relevant values.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
| `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–2500) |
| `etim_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter to values valid for this ETIM class code (e.g. "EC000001") |
| `etim_release` | string (nullable) | no | ETIM release to resolve the class version (e.g. "ETIM-9.0"); used with etim_class_code |
| `etim_feature_code` | string (nullable) | no | Filter to values valid for this ETIM feature code (e.g. "EF000001"); A-type features only |
| `search_query` | string (nullable) | no | Free-text search on value description or code |
| `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include translations for (e.g. ["nl", "en"]) |

**Example: Values for feature EF000006**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "getEtimValues",
  "params": {
    "etim_class_code": "EC002713",
    "etim_feature_code": "EF000006"
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "etim_values": [
    {
      "etim_value_code": "EV000001"
    },
    {
      "etim_value_code": "EV000002"
    },
    {
      "etim_value_code": "EV000003"
    }
  ],
  "page": {
    "number_of_items": 3,
    "items_per_page": 100,
    "number_of_pages": 1,
    "current_page": 1
  }
}
```

