Create or update a custom classification class

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `custom_class_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the custom class; omit to create a new class |
| `custom_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Unique code identifying the custom class |
| `custom_class_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the custom class |
| `is_deprecated` | boolean (nullable) | no | Mark this class as deprecated to hide it from new classifications |
| `_features` | object[] (nullable) | no | Feature assignments for this class |

**Example: Create a custom class**. Use _features to associate features with the class on creation or update.

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "saveCustomClass",
  "params": {
    "custom_class_code": "LOGISTICS",
    "custom_class_name": "Logistics"
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "custom_class_id": 1
}
```

**Example: Create a class with features and enum values**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "saveCustomClass",
  "params": {
    "custom_class_code": "COLOUR",
    "custom_class_name": "Colour",
    "_features": [
      {
        "custom_feature_id": 5,
        "order_number": 1,
        "_values": [
          {
            "custom_value_id": 10,
            "order_number": 1
          },
          {
            "custom_value_id": 11,
            "order_number": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "custom_class_id": 2
}
```

Create or update a custom classification feature

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `custom_feature_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the custom feature; omit to create a new feature |
| `custom_feature_code` | string (nullable) | no | Unique code identifying the custom feature |
| `custom_feature_type` | string (nullable) | no | Data type: A=alphanumeric, L=list, N=numeric, R=range, T=text, B=boolean, D=date, M=multiline, I=image |
| `_translations` | object[] (nullable) | no | Translated descriptions for each language |

**Example: Create a numeric feature**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "saveCustomFeature",
  "params": {
    "custom_feature_code": "WEIGHT_NET",
    "custom_feature_type": "N"
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "custom_feature_id": 1
}
```

**Example: Create a feature with translations**

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "method": "saveCustomFeature",
  "params": {
    "custom_feature_code": "KLEUR",
    "custom_feature_type": "A",
    "_translations": [
      {
        "language": "nl",
        "custom_feature_description": "Kleur"
      },
      {
        "language": "en",
        "custom_feature_description": "Colour"
      }
    ]
  },
  "id": 1
}
```

Result:

```json
{
  "custom_feature_id": 2
}
```

